    "created_at": "2017-09-04T05:41:41Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-09-04T05:41:41Z",
    "body": "I'm also finding myself wanting to have slots in the IDL during testing. Having them in the IDL would give a nicer mental model of what the underlying state machine is for an given interface.  ",
